      "description": "Research Technician, Dr. Latif-Hernandez Lab in Boston, Massachusetts | Careers at Medical & Vet-136 Harrison Ave Skip Branding Skip to Main Content toggle menu CLOSE Keyword Search Find open positions by keyword Location Search location_on Enter location Enter location Let’s go search About Benefits Opportunities DEI Community Open Positions Tufts Non-Discrimination Statement Tufts Annual Security Report On Campus Safety Human Resources Office of Equal Opportunity Accessibility Privacy © Tufts University 2022"
